<title>BELGIUM: Kredietbank eyes LatAm trade finance.</title>
<headline>Kredietbank eyes LatAm trade finance.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian bank Kredietbank has opened a global trade finance office in Madrid, the bank said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The new office will focus on trade with South America.</p>
<p>The bank also said it will soon open representative offices in Sao Paulo, Brazil and Buenos Aires, Argentina.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
